	<section_number>15.2-2029</section_number>
	<catch_line>Regulation of transportation of certain materials</catch_line>
	<text>
		Any locality may regulate the transportation of hay, coal, gasoline, explosives or other articles through the streets of the locality.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 15-6; 1960, c. 528; 1962, c. 623, § 15.1-14; 1970, c. 453; 1973, c. 402; 1990, c. 58; 1997, c. 587.</history>
